{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Sanity Loops</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sanity Loops</strong> puts you in the shoes of a student trying to find his place in a world full of strange occurrences and <strong>unexpected</strong> twists. What begins as a simple search for a job to earn money for a gift for Stacey quickly escalates into a deeper journey, challenging your perception of reality. As you take on a job at a local <strong>kiosk</strong>, you begin to experience increasingly bizarre and unsettling events that make you question <strong>what is real</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Main Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You got ability to <strong>receive messages from NPCs</strong> via chat<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629360/extras/chat-npc.gif?t=1745261944\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interactive dialog system with ability to <strong>make choices</strong>. Every choice got his own <strong>affect</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629360/extras/chat-with-boss.gif?t=1745261944\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience <strong>in-game desktop</strong> with ability to find job! <i>(Mini game will be available right after demo)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629360/extras/desktop-navigation.gif?t=1745261944\" />\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pickup</strong>, <strong>Drop</strong> and <strong>Interact</strong> with shop and <i>any other items</i><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629360/extras/shop-interaction.gif?t=1745261944\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Other\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmospheric environment</strong> and photo-realistic graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>VHS film</strong> aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pleasant interaction</strong> with products and items</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A first-person exploration game (walking simulator) where realism plays a key role. Walk through realistic locations, discover strange truths, and face unexpected challenges.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3629360?t=1745261944","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3629360?t=1745261944","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629360/82522e88be4547051bf5f9e37421efe94d3ba4f0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745261944","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629360/82522e88be4547051bf5f9e37421efe94d3ba4f0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745261944","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3668200,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Sanity Loops</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sanity Loops</strong> puts you in the shoes of a student trying to find his place in a world full of strange occurrences and <strong>unexpected</strong> twists. What begins as a simple search for a job to earn money for a gift for Stacey quickly escalates into a deeper journey, challenging your perception of reality. As you take on a job at a local <strong>kiosk</strong>, you begin to experience increasingly bizarre and unsettling events that make you question <strong>what is real</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Main Featur